# AzuraCast One-Click Bug Reporter

A massive thank you to the **@AzuraCast** team for building an incredible, free, open-source radio platform. 

## The Problem
Reporting bugs in open-source software can be difficult for non-technical users. Finding logs, navigating GitHub, and filling out templates takes too much time. 

## The Solution
This is a drop-in JavaScript widget. It adds a simple "Report Bug" button to the AzuraCast dashboard. When clicked, it automatically grabs the user's browser info, the current page URL, and pre-fills a GitHub issue template so the user just has to hit "Submit."

## How to Install
Add the `bug-reporter.js` script to your AzuraCast custom branding or frontend assets.

